<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Veller Partners — Investment Banking & Financial Advisory</title>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="header-inner">
      <a href="/" class="logo">Veller Partners</a>
      <nav>
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>Veller Partners</h1>
        <p class="tagline">Investment Banking & Financial Advisory</p>
        <p class="subtitle">Trusted strategic and financial advice for growth-focused companies.</p>
        <a href="#contact" class="cta-btn">Get in Touch</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="services" class="services">
      <h2>Our Services</h2>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>M&A Advisory</h3>
          <p>Buy-side and sell-side merger & acquisition advisory, from strategy to closing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Capital Raising</h3>
          <p>Debt and equity capital solutions tailored to your growth stage and objectives.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Strategic Consulting</h3>
          <p>Corporate strategy, valuation, and financial modeling to drive informed decisions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Restructuring</h3>
          <p>Financial restructuring and turnaround advisory to restore stability and value.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="about">
      <h2>About Us</h2>
      <p>Veller Partners is a boutique investment banking firm providing senior-level attention
        to every engagement. We combine deep industry expertise with a commitment to delivering
        results that align with our clients' long-term goals.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="contact">
      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Ready to discuss how we can help? Reach out for a confidential consultation.</p>
      <a href="mailto:info@vellerpartners.com" class="cta-btn">info@vellerpartners.com</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Veller Partners. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p class="disclaimer">Veller Partners is a financial advisory firm. This website is for informational purposes only
        and does not constitute an offer or solicitation to buy or sell any securities.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <style is:global>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a2e; }
    .site-header { background: #0f1923; padding: 1rem 2rem; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
    .header-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
    .logo { color: #c5a572; text-decoration: none; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    nav a { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; margin-left: 1.5rem; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    nav a:hover { color: #c5a572; }
    .hero { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f1923 0%, #1a2a3a 100%); color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 6rem 2rem; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 3rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; letter-spacing: 2px; }
    .tagline { font-size: 1.3rem; color: #c5a572; margin: 0 0 1rem; font-style: italic; }
    .subtitle { font-size: 1.1rem; opacity: 0.85; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 2rem; }
